@startuml
title SD-UI04 — Standard payment and cash
caption To-Be draft | F04 · Frontend · Customer /orders/:id · merchant /merchant/orders/:id
actor User
boundary "Route and ChargePanel, ProofForm and SettlementReview" as UI
participant "Shared API client" as Client
participant "Authorized API" as API
User -> UI : Open view or submit action
opt Customer considers cancellation
 alt Transfer sent or uncertain
  UI --> User : Show external merchant WhatsApp contact
 else No transfer
  UI -> Client : Send versioned cancellation with confirmation
 end
end
UI -> Client : Fetch payment or submit settlement action
Client -> API : Fetch or submit with applicable guards
alt Success
 API --> Client : Current typed result
 Client --> UI : Render or refresh authoritative data
 opt Current standard top-up request
  UI --> User : Show outstanding amount and deadline or proof under review
 end
else deadline expired or verification mismatch
 API --> Client : Typed failure
 Client --> UI : Refresh order and explain merchant follow-up
end
@enduml
